Z||000006||stimpy||10-23-2001||12:55 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by maryjane:<BR>[B] During this month-long fast, nothing of any entertainment, other than prayers and visiting family & friends is allowed. [B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So I take it that fun little diversions like turning thousand of innocent people into so much fleshy confetti will be out of the question? No mailing anthrax during the daylight hours? I say screw em, and if people of the muslim faith have a problem with that, they should start pressuring the powers that be to turn over Bin-Ladin and his co-horts.<p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 10-23-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000007||Mach10||10-23-2001||01:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B>[b]I keep seeing stuff like this (from Yahoo's news)...</B><P> <B>Why is it important to them that we show any mercy on the Taliban outlaws, just because of the Muslim holidays?  If they denounce them as not being true keepers of their faith, then why the heck do they keep defending them?  I say if they still haven't been wiped out by then, don't stop going after em!!!  They must be killed, so what's the big woof whether we do it before or after <I>anybody's</I> holiday?</B><P>[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, you have to understand that most of the Muslim world sees the Taliban as "crusaders" for Islamic purity. In other words, they kinda stand for all that is good and right with Islam. Well, at least they WERE until the later 90s, AFTER they had established a solid foothold. That's when the attrocities started. And of course, the Taliban is run by a group of high-priests. So therefore, attacks on the Taliban would be similar to attacking the Vatican (for those of the Catholic persuasion).<P>One thing to note is that the Taliban had more of less nothing to do with the WTC bombings (unless there is information I am not aware of). What the US is slamming them for is harboring OSB, and showing themselves to be a terrorist-favoring nation. In essence, the only thing the Taliban has done for OSB is to give him a roof over his head, and a place to stand in... <P>On the other hand, The Talibans are a bunch of rabid lunatics bent on the destruction of anything resembling independant thought, and any peace between the middle east and us Westerners. Just the attrocites committed by these deranged crack-head freaks is MORE than enough to warrant their immediate and total extermination, IMHO. Respect the holiday, just to show that you're better than them, and to keep some semblence of goodwill in that part of the world, then continue to make Chunky Taliban Salsa with Extra Bits. <P>||||reg||8
