Z||000011||Cheever3000||10-23-2001||09:54 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>the Taliban had more of less nothing to do with the WTC bombings (unless there is information I am not aware of).<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>One of the terrorists arrested for a previous bombing said (after his conviction) that the 9/11 attacks would <I>not</I> have happened <I>without</I> the Taliban's approval.  I saw that in one of the popular news websites.<P>"No, we're not fighting during Ramadan.  It's <I>target practice</I>, yeah, that's it."<P><BR>||||reg||1
